      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Piliciti gucoko monygi ducu i Apek; ki jo Icrael gutoŋo gonygi i ŋet waŋ it ma tye i Jejreel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwodi pa jo Piliciti gumol gukato ki jogi miya miya ki alip alip, ki Daudi ki jone bene gumol gukato lacen kacel ki Akic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ludito mony pa jo Piliciti gupenyo ni, “Jo Ibru gitimo gin aŋo kany?” Akic ogamo doggi kun wacci, “Man aye Daudi ma yam latic pa Caulo kabaka me Icrael. Otyeko doŋ bedo kweda pi kare malac mada. Cakke ki i nino ma olaro bota o kwede wa onyoo peya anoŋo roc mo i kome.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ludito mony pa jo Piliciti gubedo ki kiniga i kom Akic; guwacce ni, “Cwal laco meno odok paco. Myero odok cen i kabedo ma yam imiyo bote, En pe bicito kwedwa i mony, miyo en bilokke doko lamerokwa ki kunnu, Ka nyer-ri mito dok ribbe ki laditte bitimo aŋo? Pe neko jowa, coko wigi tero bo te? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cam 18.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye Daudi kikome, ma yam giwere kun mon gimyelo kwede ma giwero ni, ‘Caulo oneko mere dano alip, ento Daudi oneko alip apar.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akic olwoŋo Daudi, owaco bote ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwo-ni in ibedo dano ma ageno. An aneno ni ber iwot kacel kwedwa i mony, pien pe anoŋo gin mo marac i komi cakke ki i nino ma ibino iye bota o wa onyoo. Ento pe cwiny rwodi oniaŋ i komi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pienno ber itugi dok cen cut. Dok cen ki kuc keken, wek pe imi cwiny rwodi pa Lupiliciti obed ka cwer.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi owaco bot Akic ni, “Ento an atimo gin aŋo? Gin aŋo ma inoŋo i koma laditta, cakke wa i nino ma adonyo kwede i dog ticci nio koni, ma miyo pe acito ka lweny ki lumerokki, rwoda kabaka?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akic dok omedo dok iye ki Daudi ni, “Aŋeyo maber ni bal mo pe i komi; ki i nyima in icalo lamalaika pa Lubaŋa, Ento ludito monywa gutyeko waco ni, in pe ibicito kwedwa i mony, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kombeddi doŋ itugi a ki odiko-ni, kacel ki joni ma iloyogi ma gubino kwedi. Cak wot ki odiko-ni, a woko ki kany oyotoyot tekke piny leŋ ma romo wot.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ocako a woko odiko con ki jone, ci odok i lobo pa jo Piliciti. Ento jo Piliciti gucito i Jejreel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
